  "limitations": [
    "All rows remain source/host evidence only; no Android device evidence exists.",
    "Alarm exact/allow-while-idle flags, repeating cadence and offline recovery are source-wired, but Android wakeup, Doze, reboot, quota and OEM timing behavior remain unverified.",
    "Notification ownership, channel/group lifecycle, foreground-service mapping and PendingIntent metadata are persistent; host SystemUI interaction and OEM listener/callback behavior remain unverified.",
